==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*pent-}}
From {{inh|ru|orv|путь}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*pǫtь}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*pántis}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*póntoh₁s}} (whence also {{cog|la|pōns}}, {{cog|grc|πόντος}}, {{cog|en|find}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-путь.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|utʲ|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b||m|gen_sg=пути́|dat_sg=пути́|adj=путево́й}}

# [[way]], [[path]], [[road]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''[[по]] пути́''' [[в]] [[Петербу́рг]].|He’s '''on his way to''' St. Petersburg.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кружно́й]] '''путь'''|roundabout way}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[прокла́дывать]]/[[проложи́ть]] [[путь]]|to make '''a path/road'''; break '''a trail'''}}
# [[track]], [[line]]
# [[means]]
# [[trip]], [[journey]]
# [[route]]

